ros-jazzy-openvino-node (1.1.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add YOLO26 pipelines for object detection, instance segmentation, keypoint
    detection, oriented bounding boxes, classification, semantic segmentation
    and depth estimation, and export_yolo26.sh to export their models.
  * Use label files that match the models of the sample pipelines, for
    example the COCO labels for ssdlite_mobilenet_v2.
  * Remove the YOLOv5, YOLOv7 and YOLOv8 sample pipelines and the unused
    label and parameter files.

